## API reference

### mergeProps

```ts
function mergeProps(
  ...sources: Array<Record<PropertyKey, unknown> | null | undefined>
): Record<PropertyKey, unknown>;
```

<DocsTable columns={mergePropsColumns} rows={mergePropsRows} minWidth="var(--ds-sizing-xl)" />

### child

```ts
type ChildSnippet = Snippet<[
  {
    props: Record<PropertyKey, unknown>;
  }
]>;
```

<DocsTable columns={childColumns} rows={childRows} minWidth="var(--ds-sizing-xl)" />

The exact properties depend on the component. Consult that component's API Reference to see whether it supports `child` and which native element semantics it expects.
